{"recall":{"defs":[["Mini-batch GD","θ ← θ − η·(1/B)Σ∇L_i."],["Momentum","Velocity v ← βv + g; θ ← θ − ηv."],["Nesterov","Gradient evaluated at the look-ahead point."],["AdaGrad","Divide by √(sum of squared gradients)."],["RMSprop","Divide by √(moving average of squared gradients)."],["Adam","Momentum + RMSprop + bias correction."],["AdamW","Adam with decoupled weight decay."],["Warmup","Ramp η up from 0 at the start."],["Gradient clipping","Cap ‖g‖ (or each g_i) at τ."],["Early stopping","Stop after 'patience' epochs without validation improvement; restore best."]],"formulas":["\\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\eta\\,\\mathbf g","\\mathbf v_t=\\beta\\mathbf v_{t-1}+\\mathbf g_t,\\ \\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\eta\\mathbf v_t","\\mathbf s_t=\\gamma\\mathbf s_{t-1}+(1-\\gamma)\\mathbf g_t^2,\\ \\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\frac{\\eta}{\\sqrt{\\mathbf s_t+\\epsilon}}\\mathbf g_t","\\hat{\\mathbf m}_t=\\frac{\\mathbf m_t}{1-\\beta_1^t},\\ \\hat{\\mathbf v}_t=\\frac{\\mathbf v_t}{1-\\beta_2^t},\\ \\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\frac{\\eta\\hat{\\mathbf m}_t}{\\sqrt{\\hat{\\mathbf v}_t}+\\epsilon}","\\text{AdamW: }\\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\eta(\\hat{\\mathbf m}/(\\sqrt{\\hat{\\mathbf v}}+\\epsilon)+\\lambda\\theta)","\\eta_t=\\eta_{min}+\\tfrac12(\\eta_{max}-\\eta_{min})(1+\\cos(\\pi t/T))","\\mathbf g\\leftarrow\\tau\\,\\mathbf g/\\|\\mathbf g\\|\\ \\text{if}\\ \\|\\mathbf g\\|>\\tau"],"takeaways":["Learning rate first.","Momentum smooths and accelerates; needs smaller η.","Adam/AdamW: robust default (0.001, 0.9, 0.999).","Warmup + cosine; clip by norm 1–5.","Monitor curves; early stopping with patience."],"confused":[["AdaGrad vs RMSprop","Sum (rate → 0) vs moving average."],["L2 vs weight decay (AdamW)","Gradient term rescaled by adaptivity vs direct shrink."],["Norm vs value clipping","Keeps direction vs may rotate it."],["Momentum vs Nesterov","Gradient at current vs look-ahead point."],["Epoch vs iteration","Pass over data vs one update."]],"minute":"Deep networks are trained by iterative optimisation. Mini-batch gradient descent updates θ ← θ − ηg with batches of 32–256; on the elongated bowl w₁² + 4w₂² a single η moves w₂ too aggressively and w₁ too slowly. Momentum accumulates a velocity v ← βv + g (β = 0.9) to accelerate consistent directions and damp oscillation, but needs a smaller η; Nesterov evaluates the gradient after a look-ahead. AdaGrad divides by the root of accumulated squared gradients and eventually stalls; RMSprop uses a moving average (γ = 0.9). Adam combines both moments with bias correction (β₁ = 0.9, β₂ = 0.999, η = 0.001) and moves roughly η per step; AdamW decouples weight decay. Learning-rate schedules (step, exponential, cosine) plus warmup, gradient clipping by norm (τ 1–5), the linear scaling rule for batch size, debugging from loss curves and early stopping complete the toolkit. Tune η first, then batch size, then the schedule."},"flashcards":[["One GD step on x² + y² from (3, 4), η = 0.1","(2.4, 3.2); loss 25 → 16"],["Saddle point","∇L = 0 but not a minimum; up in some directions, down in others"],["Updates per epoch: N = 10,000, B = 32","≈ 313"],["Toy problem","L = w₁² + 4w₂², ∇ = [2w₁, 8w₂], start (4, 2), loss 32"],["GD losses (η = 0.1)","32 → 10.88 → 6.58 → 4.21"],["Momentum update","v ← βv + g; θ ← θ − ηv (β = 0.9)"],["Momentum example (η = 0.05) w₂ path","2 → 1.2 → 0 → −1.08 → −1.62 (oscillates)"],["Nesterov","Gradient at θ − (look-ahead along v)"],["AdaGrad problem","s grows forever → effective LR → 0"],["RMSprop defaults","γ = 0.9, η = 0.001, ε = 1e-8"],["RMSprop first effective rates","0.020 (w₁), 0.010 (w₂)"],["Adam defaults","η = 0.001, β₁ = 0.9, β₂ = 0.999, ε = 1e-8"],["Adam bias correction","m̂ = m/(1 − β₁ᵗ), v̂ = v/(1 − β₂ᵗ)"],["Adam toy steps","≈ η = 0.05 per step: 32 → 30.81 → 29.65 → 28.51"],["AdamW update","θ − η(m̂/(√v̂ + ε) + λθ)"],["Step decay example","0.1 → 0.01 after 30 epochs (γ = 0.1)"],["Cosine annealing","η_min + ½(η_max − η_min)(1 + cos(πt/T))"],["Warmup","η_t = η₀ t/T_warmup; 5–10 epochs"],["Norm clipping","g ← τg/‖g‖ if ‖g‖ > τ; keeps direction"],["Linear scaling rule","Double the batch → double the LR"],["Tuning priority","LR → batch size → schedule → optimiser specifics"]],"coverage":{"topics":[{"simple":["what","why","h1"],"deep":["o10-why","o10-loss"],"viz":[],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h2"],"deep":["o10-challenges"],"viz":[],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h3","h4"],"deep":["o10-variants","o10-toy","o10-lr"],"viz":["optRace"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h5","demo"],"deep":["o10-momentum","o10-nesterov"],"viz":["optRace"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h6"],"deep":["o10-whyadaptive","o10-adagrad","o10-rmsprop","o10-rmsex"],"viz":["optRace"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h7"],"deep":["o10-adam","o10-adamex","o10-adampop"],"viz":["optRace","adamBias"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h8"],"deep":["o10-sched","o10-warmup"],"viz":["scheduleLab"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h9","h10"],"deep":["o10-clip","o10-landscape"],"viz":["clipLab"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h10"],"deep":["o10-debug","o10-stop"],"viz":["earlyStop"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h11","takeaways"],"deep":["o10-compare","o10-hyper","o10-practice"],"viz":["optPicker"],"status":"complete"}],"elements":[["Why optimisation matters","rule","o10-why"],["GD iteration example","worked example","o10-why"],["Loss functions and gradients table","table","o10-loss"],["Challenges: saddles, plateaus, non-convexity","rule","o10-challenges"],["Challenges visualisation","diagram","o10-challenges"],["GD variants comparison","table","o10-variants"],["Algorithm 1: mini-batch GD","algorithm","o10-variants"],["Toy problem","definition","o10-toy"],["Mini-batch GD numerical example","worked example","o10-toy"],["Learning-rate effects","diagram","o10-lr"],["Motivation for adaptive techniques","rule","o10-lr"],["Momentum intuition and equations","equation","o10-momentum"],["Momentum visualisation","diagram","o10-momentum"],["Algorithm 2: SGD with momentum","algorith